# Compile with `python manage.py compilepo` — not `compilemessages`, which
# needs GNU gettext installed. See core/management/commands/compilepo.py.
#
# Coverage is the site chrome and the two browse boards. Anything not listed
# here still renders in English; an entry with an empty msgstr does the same,
# so a half-finished line is safe to leave in place.
